						"state": "Dying #4",
						"value": "Math.round(-$hp * 4)",
						"explanation": "- Roll vs. HT to avoid death\n- Roll vs. HT-4 every second to avoid falling unconscious\n- Move and Dodge are halved (B419)",
						"ops": [
